id: pm-p3x4
title: "pm activity --compact --json emits an empty activity:[] decoy key alongside compact_activity"
description: Remove the empty activity decoy from compact JSON and establish one unambiguous activity payload key without breaking alias compatibility.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 3
tags[3]: agent-ux,cli,token-efficiency
