updated_at: "2026-07-26T06:05:39.472Z"
author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 60
acceptance_criteria: compact --json emits exactly one activity key (no empty decoy array); MCP activity envelope matches; contracts/docs state the compact JSON shape; regression test asserts the empty key is absent
